//
// AppStore.xcconfig
//
// Your app's App Store page, which the forced-update screen (NeedAppUpdatesView)
// opens from its Update App button. APP_STORE_ID is your app's Apple ID, the
// number at the end of its App Store URL (https://apps.apple.com/app/id<Apple ID>;
// App Store Connect > your app > App Information > Apple ID). It is built into
// Info.plist (AppStoreID) and read at launch.
//
// Empty, as committed, hides the Update App button: the screen still asks users
// to install the new version, which they get from the App Store app. A value
// that is not all digits also hides it, and InfoPlistTest fails on it.
//
// Set it here in your own app's repository, or in AppStore.local.xcconfig
// (gitignored), e.g.
//
//   APP_STORE_ID = 1234567890
//
// Applies to both Debug and Release (the project-level base configuration,
// through Project.xcconfig).

APP_STORE_ID =

#include? "AppStore.local.xcconfig"
